// A program that depends on a package and reaches none of its kama. The package links a system library this machine
// does not have and passes the C compiler an argument it does not know, so a build carrying either fails. A package
// adds nothing to the C command line of a program that imports nothing from it: no library, flag, include path or
// setting, as its `csources` are left out (tests/csources_dep_unreached.d).
fn uint8 main() { return 42; }
